{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Legendary Feat\n\nPrerequisites: Spellcasting or Pact Magic Feature, 20 in your Spellcasting Ability Score.\n\nYou have mastered the movements and incantations of spells, allowing you to go beyond your magical limits for an instance, unleashing a flurry of spells in a row.\n\nOnce per long rest, you can use your action to use your Arcane Barrage, allowing you to cast a number of spells or cantrips equal to your Spellcasting modifier in the same turn with this action, bypassing the \"once per turn\" spell limitation. You still need spell slots (if it is not a cantrip) or uses of the spell (if given by a feature or feat) in order to use a spell in the barrage, consuming one each time you cast it. You can’t use spells with a casting time of more than one action or bonus action. The level of the spells must be equal or lower to half your proficiency bonus (rounded up).\n\nAfter using this feature, you gain 3 levels of exhaustion.","level":1}],"id":"Customf3168ae1-2a66-4b30-bd77-fd45be494af0","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Arcane Barrage [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}